  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Qasr Al-Farafra"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Qasr Al-"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "Farafra"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", once a quaint village resting in the low grounds, has witnessed a transformation under the touch of modernity. The ancient hilltop village, a treasure trove of history, now finds itself partially obscured by the advance of modern infrastructure. Its backdrop, a lush expanse of palm groves, tells a story of a land where tradition meets progress."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Farafra,_Egypt",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Old Meets the New "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000a"
              ],
              "text": "Qasr Al-Farafra"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", the march of time is evident. The "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "village’s once-dominant mud-brick houses"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", adorned with flowing pediments and crenellations that spoke of a simpler era, are gradually giving way to more contemporary breeze-block homes, complete with modern amenities like proper bathrooms. This architectural evolution mirrors the village’s "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000010"
              ],
              "text": "journey"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " from its historic roots into the present day."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/farafra-oasis-travel-guide/getting-around/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/farafra-oasis-travel-guide/getting-around/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/nubian-lodges-in-aswan-abu-simbel/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/nubian-lodges-in-aswan-abu-simbel/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/hurghada-travel-guide/journeys/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/hurghada-travel-guide/journeys/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Growing Community "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Over the past two decades, Qasr’s population has burgeoned to five thousand, a testament to improved healthcare and living standards. Yet, despite this growth and the emergence of a few opulent villas on the town’s periphery, life in Qasr remains largely grounded in simplicity. The "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000017"
              ],
              "text": "local shops and market"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", though modest, reflect a community where frugality is still a way of life, even amidst signs of wealth."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/aswan-travel-guide/aswan-local-market/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/aswan-travel-guide/aswan-local-market/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Evenings in Qasr "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "As night falls, the village settles into a quiet rhythm. Locals gather in teahouses, the community’s social hubs, sharing stories and enjoying each other’s company. For those seeking relaxation, the hot spring at Bir Setta offers a soothing respite. Occasionally, one might stumble upon a zikr, a spiritual gathering, in a local home."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Respectful Invitation "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "These zikrs play a pivotal role in the religious and social fabric of Farafra. Foreigners are welcomed to these gatherings, provided they approach with respect and understanding. Participation in a zikr is an invitation to observe a sacred ritual, not a tourist spectacle. Modest dress and behavior are expected, as guests are offered a rare glimpse into the spiritual heart of the community."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Farafra-Oasis-1.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A lone hiker traversing the sculpted dunes and rock formations of a desert landscape with patches of snow."
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Contrasts of Nature: A lone explorer's journey through Farafra's sandy vastness, where the desert's heat clings to the cold touch of winter's snow"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Farafra_Egypt.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A caravan of vehicles parked in a sweeping desert landscape with towering sand formations"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Adventure meets serenity in the Farafra Desert, Egypt"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Qasr Al-Farafra "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Qasr Al-Farafra, antaño una pintoresca aldea que descansaba en los terrenos bajos, ha sido testigo de una transformación bajo el toque de la modernidad."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El antiguo pueblo de la colina, un tesoro de historia, se encuentra ahora parcialmente oscurecido por el avance de la infraestructura moderna."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Su telón de fondo, una exuberante extensión de palmerales, cuenta la "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000007"
              ],
              "text": "historia"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " de una tierra donde la tradición se encuentra con el progreso."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/explorando-la-gran-esfinge-de-guiza/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/explorando-la-gran-esfinge-de-guiza/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Lo viejo se encuentra con lo nuevo "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En Qasr Al-Farafra, el paso del tiempo es evidente."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Las "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000010"
              ],
              "text": "casas de adobe del"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " pueblo, antaño dominantes, adornadas con frontones y almenas que hablaban de una época más sencilla, están dando paso gradualmente a casas más contemporáneas de bloques de brisa, con servicios modernos como cuartos de baño adecuados."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Esta evolución arquitectónica refleja el "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000015"
              ],
              "text": "viaje"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " del pueblo desde sus raíces históricas hasta nuestros días. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-port-said/casa-del-canal-de-suez/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-port-said/casa-del-canal-de-suez/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-alejandria/viaje/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-alejandria/viaje/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una comunidad en crecimiento "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En las dos últimas décadas, la población de Qasr ha crecido hasta alcanzar "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001c"
              ],
              "text": "los cinco mil"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " habitantes, gracias a la mejora de la asistencia sanitaria y del nivel de vida."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Sin embargo, a pesar de este crecimiento y de la aparición de algunas villas opulentas en la periferia de la ciudad, la vida en Qasr sigue basándose en gran medida en la sencillez."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Las tiendas y el "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000023"
              ],
              "text": "mercado locales"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", aunque modestos, reflejan una comunidad en la que la frugalidad sigue siendo una forma de vida, incluso en medio de signos de riqueza. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-el-cairo/el-cairo-al-descubierto-en-la-ciudad-de-los-mil-minaretes/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-el-cairo/el-cairo-al-descubierto-en-la-ciudad-de-los-mil-minaretes/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/7-cosas-inolvidables-que-hacer-en-aswan/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/7-cosas-inolvidables-que-hacer-en-aswan/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Veladas en Qasr "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000039",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Al caer la noche, el pueblo se instala en un ritmo tranquilo."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Los lugareños se reúnen en las casas de té, los centros sociales de la comunidad, compartiendo "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002c"
              ],
              "text": "historias y disfrutando de la"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " compañía de los demás."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000032",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000031"
              ],
              "text": "Para los que"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000033",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " buscan relajarse, las aguas termales de Bir Setta ofrecen un respiro tranquilizador."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000034",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000035",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Ocasionalmente, uno puede tropezar con un zikr, una reunión espiritual, en "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000037",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000036"
              ],
              "text": "una casa local"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000038",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/arenas-de-la-historia-tour-de-los-templos-de-dendera-y-abydos-desde-hurghada/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/arenas-de-la-historia-tour-de-los-templos-de-dendera-y-abydos-desde-hurghada/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/categoria-para-visitar-en-aswan/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/categoria-para-visitar-en-aswan/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000036",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/hoteles-economicos-cerca-de-las-piramides/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/hoteles-economicos-cerca-de-las-piramides/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una invitación respetuosa "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Estos zikrs desempeñan un papel fundamental en el tejido religioso y social de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000003d"
              ],
              "text": "Farafra"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000040",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000041",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000043",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000042"
              ],
              "text": "Los extranjeros son"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000044",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " bienvenidos a estas reuniones, siempre que se acerquen con respeto y comprensión."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000045",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000046",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " La participación en un zikr es "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000048",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000047"
              ],
              "text": "una invitación a observar"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000049",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " un ritual sagrado, no un espectáculo turístico."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Se espera una vestimenta y un comportamiento modestos, ya "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000004c"
              ],
              "text": "que se ofrece a los invitados una"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " rara visión del corazón espiritual de la comunidad. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
